---
import '../styles/global.css'; 
---

<section class="py-[68px]">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5">
        <div class="text-center" data-anim>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-red mb-3.5">Know the warning signs</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[38px] font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-3.5">6 Signs Your CRM Is <em class="not-italic text-red">Costing You Clients</em></h2>
          <p class="max-w-[58ch] mx-auto mb-10 text-text-dim text-[16.5px]">If any of these sound like your week, the hours are already leaking.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-[22px]" data-anim style="--d:0.00s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-gold-deep tracking-wider">01</div>
            <h3 class="text-[16.5px] font-extrabold my-1.5">Meeting prep takes 45+ minutes</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-dim mb-2.5">Hunting through notes, emails, and files before every client meeting.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red bg-[#F6E7E4] rounded px-2.25 py-1">Time Drain</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-[22px]" data-anim style="--d:0.07s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c1.5-3.5 4.5-5 8-5s6.5 1.5 8 5"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-gold-deep tracking-wider">02</div>
            <h3 class="text-[16.5px] font-extrabold my-1.5">You're the information bottleneck</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-dim mb-2.5">Every client detail lives in your head, so your team can't move without asking you.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red bg-[#F6E7E4] rounded px-2.25 py-1">Scaling Risk</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-[22px]" data-anim style="--d:0.14s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M5 15V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-gold-deep tracking-wider">03</div>
            <h3 class="text-[16.5px] font-extrabold my-1.5">Same data, three systems</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-dim mb-2.5">Duplicate entry across your CRM, planning software, and spreadsheets.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red bg-[#F6E7E4] rounded px-2.25 py-1">Wasted Hours</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-[22px]" data-anim style="--d:0.21s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3 2.5 20h19L12 3z"/><path d="M12 10v4"/><path d="M12 17.5h.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-gold-deep tracking-wider">04</div>
            <h3 class="text-[16.5px] font-extrabold my-1.5">Tasks fall through the cracks</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-dim mb-2.5">Follow-ups tracked in Slack, sticky notes, and memory. Until one slips.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red bg-[#F6E7E4] rounded px-2.25 py-1">Client Risk</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-[22px]" data-anim style="--d:0.28s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M9 9l6 6M15 9l-6 6"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-gold-deep tracking-wider">05</div>
            <h3 class="text-[16.5px] font-extrabold my-1.5">Your team avoids the CRM</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-dim mb-2.5">It was built for generic sales teams, so everyone works around it instead of in it.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red bg-[#F6E7E4] rounded px-2.25 py-1">Low Adoption</span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-line rounded-custom p-[22px]" data-anim style="--d:0.35s">
            <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20V6"/><path d="M4 20h16"/><path d="M9 16v-5"/><path d="M14 16V8"/><path d="M19 16v-3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="text-xs font-black text-gold-deep tracking-wider">06</div>
            <h3 class="text-[16.5px] font-extrabold my-1.5">Reporting means exporting</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-dim mb-2.5">Firm-level visibility requires spreadsheet surgery every quarter.</p>
            <span class="inline-block text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wider uppercase text-red bg-[#F6E7E4] rounded px-2.25 py-1">Blind Spots</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="text-center pb-2" data-anim>
      <a class="inline-block bg-red text-white font-extrabold rounded-lg px-8 py-3.75 text-base hover:bg-[#5C1010] transition-colors focus-visible:outline-3 focus-visible:outline-ink focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="#leadForm">Show Me the Hours I'd Get Back</a>
    </div>